(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-gateway/src/server.asl#cliAdmit!" :text "asks the balancer before a vendor CLI run: picks over the cli lane, refuses when its budgets are at the hard cap, else charges the picked alias with the prompt-size estimate; no pool or no cli lane admits")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-gateway/src/server.asl#keyFilesWorldEnv!" :text "the env the chat effects read: the process env overlaid, per provider row with a keyEnv, by the value a key file of the config holds; the file wins; an unloadable table leaves the env as it was")
